{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/794293-hidden-knowledge","id":794293,"title":"Hidden Knowledge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-28T11:44:59-08:00","id":794293,"title":"Hidden Knowledge","content":"So this is sort of an idea I came up with when reading about how the Makara like to search for knowledge. What if there are old beast relics or scrolls containing knowledge of old forgotten Avatisms that a beast could learn after long periods of study? This could provide a unique way for players to find more avatisms for their beast and as long as the appearance of these items were regulated properly by the story teller it shouldn't break the game.<br /> <br /> Perhaps there are some old relics belonging to some old eldritch beast that haunted the histories of old but have died off ages ago.<br /> <br /> Well, it is just an idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;A dark shape crawls out from your closet. At first it looks like it has a large zipper for a mouth, however as it gets closer you soon realize that it isn't a zipper at all but rows of sharp yellow teeth!&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","name":"Werescythe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T14:17:58-08:00","id":795073,"title":"","content":"I don't think that there should be artefacts which 'contain' an Atavism. Atavisms are primal expressions of a Horror, writ large upon both reality and dreams. They don't feel like something that could be contained like that. The closest thing that I think you could have to this is perhaps an ancient, lost legend about a forgotten monster which inspires the Horror to add an Atavism to itself, or perhaps a Beast that found a way to survive as a story, an ancient Horror that invades people's dreams when they read the story or hear it told and compel their victims to continue telling the tale, or the monster will never leave. Actually, that wouldn't be a half bad idea for a Chronicle. Imagine how hard it would be to kill the thing","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T14:19:22-08:00","id":795074,"title":"","content":"You might get a scroll or whatever containing a Nightmare or perhaps instructions on how to pull one out of the Dream, as Nightmares are far more cerebral than Atavisms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T15:06:32-08:00","id":795118,"title":"","content":"I think exploiting the unprecedented access to the multiverse that Beasts get would be the right way to go for this end. Items chronicling the deeds of ancient Beasts would not, in of themselves, be a direct path to more powers, but establishing Kinship to the ephemeral beings connected to that item might be a story-appropriate way to do so. <br /> <br /> Plus, Atavisms are generally developed as a refinement of the Horror itself, so another way, that I would allow in my games, would be to study Apices (plural of Apex) that have come before. If you have any Beasts Incarnate, getting to know them would go along way to growing your character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T14:02:28-08:00","id":797008,"title":"","content":"Well, the idea was that these items would contain information about these older monsters that the Beast could use to augment their nightmares and perhaps they could develop some Avatisms from this knowledge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;A dark shape crawls out from your closet. At first it looks like it has a large zipper for a mouth, however as it gets closer you soon realize that it isn't a zipper at all but rows of sharp yellow teeth!&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","name":"Werescythe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T02:48:48-08:00","id":800451,"title":"","content":"I'd definitively grant Family Tie to a long dead monster by studying his history through ancient documents. Thematically, it would be like connecting to his family by creating a genealogy tree, or like an orphan investigating to find his biological parents. And Family Tie grant new Nightmares, along with other advantages <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3648-nepher","name":"Nepher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3648_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T04:01:40-08:00","id":800503,"title":"","content":"I agree with the others saying they'd grant Family Ties and Nightmares through such a search.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}